-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), G.N. No. S 914/2021, current version as at 5 November 2026.
-- ORDER 3, RULES 1, 2, 5, 6, 7, 8 AND 9 (Rules 3 and 4 are in roc1-order-3-time.l4).
-- Source: a plain-text rendering made by a converter script from Singapore Statutes Online.
-- It is not the official text, and nothing here has been checked against the official text.
--
-- READING A RESULT.  JUST TRUE: the text says yes on these facts.  JUST FALSE: the text says no in its own words
-- (a flat negative, an "unless", a "where" or "when" that is not met, a stated period that has run, "only if").
-- NOTHING: the text does not answer (a list not closed, a grant limited by its own wording, a scope limit with no
-- "only", a term outside the sources).  A caller must never turn NOTHING into FALSE.
-- Order 3, Rule 2(1) is a caveat on every answer in these Rules and is not threaded as an input.

§§ `Order 3, Rule 1 -- the Ideals`

-- Rule 1(1): a rule of reading.  It operates on a provision of these Rules.
-- src:278 | 1. —(1) These Rules are to be given a purposive interpretation.
@ref O 3 r 1(1) (src:278)
GIVEN `the provision being read is a provision of these Rules` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 3 r 1(1) the provision is to be given a purposive interpretation` MEANS
    IF `the provision being read is a provision of these Rules`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence reaches "These Rules" only; nothing is said of any other text

-- Rule 1(2): the Ideals.  The seam S "o 3 r 1(2) the objective is one of the Ideals" of O 1 r 3(1).
DECLARE `o 3 r 1(2) an objective` IS ONE OF
    `o 3 r 1(2)(a) fair access to justice`
    `o 3 r 1(2)(b) expeditious proceedings`
    `o 3 r 1(2)(c) cost-effective work proportionate to the nature and importance of the action, the complexity of the claim and the difficulty or novelty of its issues, and the amount or value of the claim`
    `o 3 r 1(2)(d) efficient use of court resources`
    `o 3 r 1(2)(e) fair and practical results suited to the needs of the parties`
    `o 3 r 1(2) any other objective`

